"""
kernel-sandbox - SUSE Kernel Testing Suite

An orchestrator for building, imaging, and booting
custom kernel builds in QEMU VMs.

Invocation modes:
  ./scripts/kernel-sandbox/kernel-sandbox [options]            - Full pipeline orchestrator
  ./scripts/kernel-sandbox/kernel-sandbox build [options]      - Build phase only
  ./scripts/kernel-sandbox/kernel-sandbox image [options]      - Image prep phase only
  ./scripts/kernel-sandbox/kernel-sandbox boot [options]       - Boot phase only
"""

